# sreeraj.dev redesign — instance environment.
# Copy to ~/.config/sreeraj-redesign/env and chmod 600. Loaded by systemd via
# EnvironmentFile. Do NOT commit the real file.

# Auth: by default everything runs on the Claude Code SESSION (subscription/
# OAuth) — no API key needed. Leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY UNSET for this.
# Only set it if you want the (optional, non-blocking) Webwright reviewer — and
# then it MUST be valid, because setting it switches claude/the Agent SDK to
# API-billing mode for everything.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: healthchecks.io (or similar) ping URL. The runner pings
#   <URL>/start at start, <URL> on success, <URL>/fail on failure — so a
# missed/failed monthly run becomes a visible alert. Strongly recommended for
# unattended cron.
# HEALTHCHECK_URL=https://hc-ping.com/your-uuid-here

# Optional overrides (defaults shown):
# REDESIGN_REPO_URL=https://github.com/sreeo/sreeraj.git
# REDESIGN_REPO_DIR=%h/.local/share/sreeraj-redesign/repo
# REDESIGN_BASE_BRANCH=main
# REDESIGN_TREND=                # pin a specific trend instead of auto-discovery
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROME_CHANNEL=chrome
